"],["ARC or PLC in LaSalle County","/arc-plc/illinois/lasalle-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the LaSalle County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, January to February, August to September, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 54% of normal in August to September and 45% in September to October. Grid 25664 had its driest year in 1956 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
